  title: "Taxis and Private Cars \u2013 1950s "
  info: 'With increasing economic prosperity, taxis and private cars became more
    common in the 1950s. The first metered taxi service was introduced, offering
    convenient point-to-point travel. However, growing car ownership also led to
    traffic congestion, prompting the government to explore long-term transport solutions.  '
